  "explanation": {
    "short": "z is always \"ts\": zwei is TSVY and zehn is TSAYN. w is said like \"v\", and ei like \"eye\" (zwei, drei). eu is \"oy\": Euro is OY-ro.",
    "more": "The h in zehn is not said; it makes the e long. The word for 4, \"vier\", looks like ei turned round: ie is a long \"ee\" and v is said like f — FEER."
  },
